        "created_at": "2026-10-08T21:07:33.150Z",
        "cooked": "<p>For your request, I can assist by creating specific n8n workflows tailored to your automation and integration needs as a Technical Account Manager or Customer Success Manager. This would involve setting up triggers based on client interactions, followed by steps to manage customer accounts and automate reporting or communication tasks. Error handling can be incorporated to ensure that any issues in the workflow are logged and addressed without disruption. I can deliver the workflow JSON files along with setup documentation for easy implementation. If you have specific use cases or requirements for the workflows, please share them for clarity.</p>\n<p>Gilbert, GL Tools (Vienna, written communication)</p>",
